  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Samoa Parliament Complex Redevelopment Phase II: Legislative Assembly Office</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment supports the development of a modern, functional, cost-effective and climate resilient Legislative Assembly Office (LAO) building to support the functioning of Samoa&apos;s parliament. The LAO will accommodate the Office of the Speaker, Office of the Clerk, parliamentary committee meeting rooms and parliamentary library and archives. The investment will strengthen democratic governance by creating a stronger enabling environment for Samoa&apos;s parliamentary and democratic institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
